sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant L as Task Low (Prio 1)
    participant M as Task Medium (Prio 2)
    participant H as Task High (Prio 3)
    participant Mutex as FreeRTOS Mutex (pxMutexHolder)

    Note over L,Mutex: Run B: Priority Inheritance Active
    L->>Mutex: xSemaphoreTake(xMutex, portMAX_DELAY)
    Note over Mutex: Mutex records pxMutexHolder = Task Low
    L->>L: Begins critical workload (PA1 High)
    Note over H: Event triggers Task High
    H-->>L: Preempts Low (Prio 3 > Prio 1)
    H->>H: Starts execution (PA3 High)
    H->>Mutex: xSemaphoreTake(xMutex, portMAX_DELAY)
    Note over Mutex: Mutex held by Task Low. Kernel invokes xTaskPriorityInherit(Low)
    Note over L: Task Low temporarily BOOSTED to Priority 3!
    Mutex-->>H: High enters BLOCKED state
    Note over L: Task Low resumes execution AT PRIORITY 3
    Note over M: Task Medium becomes Ready (Prio 2)
    Note over M,L: Medium (Prio 2) CANNOT preempt Low (current Prio 3)!
    L->>L: Completes ~5 ms critical workload without interruption
    L->>Mutex: xSemaphoreGive(xMutex)
    Note over Mutex,L: Kernel invokes xTaskPriorityDisinherit(Low) -> Low drops to Prio 1
    L->>L: (PA1 Low)
    Mutex-->>H: High unblocks immediately and takes mutex!
    H->>H: Completes ~1 ms critical section
    H->>Mutex: xSemaphoreGive(xMutex)
    H->>H: (PA3 Low)
    Note over M: High and Low finished; Task Medium finally runs (PA2 High)
